  "id": "avlt",
  "term": "AVLT",
  "definition": "AVLT is a verbal learning and memory test used with children and adults. In this version, a person hears one 15-word list over repeated trials, then a second 15-word list, and is asked to recall the words immediately and again after a delay so performance and intrusion errors can be counted.",
